SDL-E1034 (spec/api.md)

  x `health` is not a string literal — the api route path is one
   ,----
 1 | api health { get { then: { { status: 200 } }; }; };
   :     ^^^|^^
   :        `-- the route path is a string literal
   `----
  help: the route path is a single string literal — `api '/users/:id' { … };`; SurrealDB validates the path grammar (static, `:param`, `*wildcard` segments) at define time
